### Express Products API - HTTP Client Requests
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000

### 1. API Root & Documentation
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### 2. Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 3. Get Products (Default: First 10 items)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products

### 4. Get Products with Pagination (Page 2, Limit 5)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products?page=2&limit=5

### 5. Get All 100 Products (all=true)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products?all=true

### 6. Filter by Category
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products?category=Electronics

### 7. Search Products (e.g. "wireless" or "coffee")
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products?q=wireless

### 8. Filter by Price Range ($50 to $200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products?minPrice=50&maxPrice=200

### 9. Filter by In Stock & Minimum Rating (Rating >= 4.7)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products?inStock=true&minRating=4.7

### 10. Sort by Price Descending
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products?sortBy=price&order=desc

### 11. Get Distinct Categories with Item Counts
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/categories

### 12. Get Aggregated Statistics
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/stats

### 13. Get Single Product by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/1

### 14. Create a New Product (POST)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "AeroFlight Pro Carbon Drone",
  "description": "Professional 8K camera drone with dual obstacle avoidance sensors.",
  "category": "Electronics",
  "price": 899.99,
  "discountPercentage": 10.0,
  "rating": 4.9,
  "stock": 18,
  "brand": "AeroTech",
  "tags": ["drone", "camera", "8k", "wireless"]
}

### 15. Update Product (PUT - Full Replace)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "UltraSound Pro Noise-Cancelling Headphones (Gen 2)",
  "description": "Updated version with 40-hour battery and spatial audio support.",
  "category": "Electronics",
  "price": 329.99,
  "discountPercentage": 10.0,
  "rating": 4.9,
  "stock": 50,
  "brand": "AuraTech"
}

### 16. Partial Update (PATCH)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 279.99,
  "stock": 60
}

### 17. Delete Product by ID
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/products/101

### 18. Reset Dataset Back to 100 Products
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products/reset
